 "title": "诈骗的原料",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 109.44,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.232,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "数据泄露，是下一次诈骗的名单。",
   "spoken": "数据泄漏，是下一次诈骗的名单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.052,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 4.15,
   "speechEnd": 6.566
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "攻击者知道了谁持有多少资产，住在哪里，用哪家交易所。",
   "spoken": "攻击者知道了谁持有多少资产，住在哪里，用哪家交易所。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 7.632,
   "dur": 5.568,
   "speechStart": 7.73,
   "speechEnd": 12.349
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "他就能冒充客服精准下手，甚至找上门。",
   "spoken": "他就能冒充客服精准下手，甚至找上门。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 13.42,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 13.518,
   "speechEnd": 16.649
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "打个比方，一份泄露的客户名单，就是一本肥羊通讯录。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，一份泄漏的客户名单，就是一本肥羊通讯录。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 17.696,
   "dur": 5.136,
   "speechStart": 17.794,
   "speechEnd": 21.996
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "上面有姓名、电话、存款金额，还注明他上周刚联系过客服。",
   "spoken": "上面有姓名、电话、存款金额，还注明他上周刚联系过客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 23.052,
   "dur": 6.048,
   "speechStart": 23.15,
   "speechEnd": 28.281
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立，银行流水是私密的，链上交易是公开的。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立，银航流水是私密的，链上交易是公开的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 29.32,
   "dur": 5.256,
   "speechStart": 29.418,
   "speechEnd": 33.739
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "名单里只要有一个地址，攻击者就能查到这个人全部的链上历史，和当前的余额。",
   "spoken": "名单里只要有一个地址，攻击者就能查到这个人全部的链上历史，和当前的余额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 34.796,
   "dur": 7.08,
   "speechStart": 34.894,
   "speechEnd": 41.036
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "一次泄露，会同时引出三类攻击。",
   "spoken": "一次泄漏，会同时引出三类攻击。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 42.096,
   "dur": 3.432,
   "speechStart": 42.194,
   "speechEnd": 44.694
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "第一类，精准钓鱼，冒充客服，说出真实的细节。",
   "spoken": "第一类，精准钓鱼，冒充客服，说出真实的细节。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 45.748,
   "dur": 5.424,
   "speechStart": 45.846,
   "speechEnd": 50.334
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "第二类，账号接管，拿证件信息骗过运营商，劫持手机号。",
   "spoken": "第二类，账号接管，拿证件信息骗过运营商，劫持手机号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 51.392,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 51.49,
   "speechEnd": 56.299
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "第三类，人身风险，知道住址，又知道资产。",
   "spoken": "第三类，人身风险，知道住址，又知道资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 57.372,
   "dur": 5.16,
   "speechStart": 57.47,
   "speechEnd": 61.684
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "泄露的数据还会长期流通，几年前的名单，今天还在被用来诈骗。",
   "spoken": "泄漏的数据还会长期流通，几年前的名单，今天还在被用来诈骗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 62.752,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 62.85,
   "speechEnd": 67.897
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "名单从哪里流出来？先看最集中的出口，客服后台。",
   "spoken": "名单从哪里流出来？先看最集中的出口，客服后台。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 68.972,
   "dur": 5.232,
   "speechStart": 69.07,
   "speechEnd": 73.365
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "攻击者在社交平台上，招募交易所的客服或者外包人员，开价收买。",
   "spoken": "攻击者在社交平台上，招募交易所的客服或者外包人员，开价收买。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 74.424,
   "dur": 6.216,
   "speechStart": 74.522,
   "speechEnd": 79.795
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "被收买的人，在客服后台查询用户，截屏或者导出。",
   "spoken": "被收买的人，在客服后台查询用户，截屏或者导出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 80.86,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 80.958,
   "speechEnd": 85.053
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "Coinbase 这一次，泄露的还有社保号后四位，和部分遮蔽的银行账号。",
   "spoken": "Coinbase 这一次，泄漏的还有社保号后四位，和部分遮蔽的银航账号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 86.12,
   "dur": 6.024,
   "speechStart": 86.218,
   "speechEnd": 91.301
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "攻击者随后索要 2000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "攻击者随后索要 2000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 92.364,
   "dur": 3.264,
   "speechStart": 92.462,
   "speechEnd": 94.783
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "Coinbase 拒付，拿出同等金额设立悬赏，并承诺赔偿被骗的用户。",
   "spoken": "Coinbase 拒付，拿出同等金额设立悬赏，并承诺赔偿被骗的用户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 95.848,
   "dur": 5.664,
   "speechStart": 95.946,
   "speechEnd": 100.672
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "外包商解雇了涉事员工，2025 年 12 月，印度警方逮捕了一名前客服。",
   "spoken": "外包商解雇了涉事员工，2025 年 12 月，印度警方歹捕了一名前客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
